schedule with restarts to reduce overfitting and improve generalization. Implementation: define a focal_loss function that accepts logits and targets; modify the training loop to use this loss; after warmup, switch to CosineAnnealingWarmRestarts scheduler and remove the linear scheduler step. Keep other hyperparameters (batch size, dropout, label smoothing, gradient clipping) unchanged."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
